WEBVTT

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:14.860
Yeah. You better be prepared.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:16.700
You bet.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.450
None of us will hold anything back.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.210
I won't lose.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:35.190
The fifth Field Queen Contest!

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:52.070
HIGH SCHOOL DIVISION C  CLUB

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:55.570
I decided this myself

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.570
I decided that relying on chance

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:04.080
is just so ridiculously fruitless

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:09.040
I dwelled in my fantasies too much

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:14.960
I'm going to leave my safety zone behind

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.880
I try to keep my future in my crosshairs,

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:24.180
and even though my aim is unsteady,

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:27.520
I will hold my head high

00:01:28.390 --> 00:01:31.190
I'll change my life,

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:34.230
and the gray rules that govern it

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:40.070
even if I trip and stumble on the way

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:45.990
Others are guiding me, but I will walk

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:52.710
My footprints in this world are so colorful

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:09.060
One Week Earlier

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:09.060
One Week Earlier

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:12.360
Time for airsoft!

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:14.030
Be the queens of war, soldiers!

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:15.790
I'm gonna try and get
some good hits on you again!

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:17.750
Oh, you're on!

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:20.990
Huh?

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:22.650
Well, that's odd.

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:24.970
Our pellets should be here.

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:26.950
We have none.

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:32.860
We talked about this the week before last.

00:02:32.860 --> 00:02:34.890
I told you we were low on pellets,

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:38.630
and that we should restrain ourselves a bit.

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:41.640
I think I told you yesterday, too.

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:47.930
Wh-What about the ones we bought wholesale?

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:49.020
Right! Those!

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:52.020
Oh yes, those.

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:58.530
I believe you two wasted all of them by horsing around instead of carrying them.

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:04.010
But didn't we pick all of those up?

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:04.910
Yeah, we did!

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:09.800
Using pellets that fell on the ground would produce countless jams and malfunctions!

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.040
You should know that.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:16.550
M-Maybe we could start recycling?

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:21.550
Do you have any idea how expensive that would be?

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:24.880
Really, do you two ever even listen to me?

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:28.240
You never think before you act.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.680
Especially you, Karira.

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.450
You're in eleventh grade!

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:35.020
You have to choose your courses for next year and study for exams!

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:38.670
You can't make a living by playing airsoft all day!

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:45.850
Did you even decide on whether you want to enroll by recommendation or through the entrance exams?

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:51.260
Look, I'm not saying this out of hatred or anything...

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:56.090
I just want to have fun playing airsoft with everyone.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.630
Are you listening?!

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:59.050
What's going on here?

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:00.630
Can't go a day without a fight?

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:02.880
Sono!

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.440
Rescue us from the old witch!

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:06.890
Old wi—

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:09.080
Karira!

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:13.390
What, is that all?

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.670
"Is that all"?

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:17.900
It's a big problem if you ask me.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:21.200
We can't practice without pellets.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:24.120
Then just win this.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:28.910
Field Queen Contest?

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:33.180
You get a year's supply of pellets if you win this.

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:36.080
Sono, why do you know that?

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:38.650
Because they did that last year.

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:41.880
All the pellets we've been using 'til now came from its prize.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:45.550
I didn't know you entered that contest.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:50.860
I hadn't met you all back then.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:52.970
I wanted to fight good airsoft opponents,

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:56.310
and one of the contest's categories had actual fighting.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:59.480
That's seriously why you entered?

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:03.150
Sono, you're amazing!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.450
Looks like they got a few more prizes this year, too!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:07.770
Seriously?!

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:10.120
Those are the latest Boy's Gun models!

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:14.540
So, whoever wins can basically play airsoft 'til they drop!

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.170
Two birds, one stone.

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.680
Hell yeah!

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:19.130
Let's go!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:22.340
But can we really win that easily?

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.040
It can't be that hard.

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:25.900
I mean, even Sono won.

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:27.470
Oh, it's on.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:32.030
Besides, pedophilia is totally hip these days!

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:33.720
We have skill at arms.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.690
We have beauty.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:36.810
We will win!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:38.910
Good luck.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:48.430
All right! Let's have a practice skirm!

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:49.550
Good idea.

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:50.720
I'm in.

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:53.020
I'm so motivated!

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.780
Let's go!

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.910
Um, we don't have pellets...

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:06.300
Welcome, fans of airsoft across the country!

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:13.920
The only ones that passed the fifth Field Queen Contest's harsh qualifiers are...

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:15.890
these sixteen beauties!

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:24.650
Who will show us the most beautiful and deadly airsoft play we've ever seen?

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.820
And who will be left standing to claim this contest's glorious crown?!

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:31.130
Why's Daishichi running this?

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:34.600
He's got some connections to the sponsors.

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:40.290
His face is kind of taking up the entire screen...

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:43.710
I get Aoi being here,

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:45.840
but why is Aira entering?

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.760
Wasn't there another bracket for boys in drag?

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:49.770
Seriously?

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:51.820
Sic transit gloria mundi.

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:52.470
Actually...

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.600
she's the one I'm most surprised about.

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:02.310
Wh-Why are you...

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:06.090
My team entered me without my permission.

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:06.860
That said...

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:10.190
your entry changes things quite a bit.

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:12.650
I'll make certain you don't win.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.650
Oh, you are so on!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:24.380
Commentary will be provided by last year's queen, Kashima Sonora!

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:26.880
S-Sonora was the queen?!

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:30.570
She didn't know?

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:32.130
Looks like it.

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:36.100
I'll be the heir to Sonora's throne anyway.

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:38.770
Not with me around, you won't!

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:43.100
Time to introduce the contestants!

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:45.610
The first one is...

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:51.400
Stella Girls' Academy's Hatsuse Karira!

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.400
I'm Hatsuse Karira.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:55.550
I'm sixteen.

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:56.810
I'm in eleventh grade.

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:57.620
Nice to meet you.

00:07:58.250 --> 00:07:59.370
So cute!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.620
So cool!

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:04.890
Here, we also judge your fashion sense.

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:07.340
What do you think about her, Kashima?

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:09.130
An utter failure.

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:11.560
That's harsh.

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:15.150
Her outfit seems to be designed for practicality.

00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:17.890
No, it's just her personality.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.890
She's like an old geezer inside.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:24.150
You bastard.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:30.540
I'm Mutsu Honoka.

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:31.440
I'm sixteen.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.340
I'm in eleventh grade.

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:36.630
I'm a staff officer in my team.

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:46.220
I'm Kirishima Rento.

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:47.100
I'm sixteen.

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:48.190
I'm in tenth grade.

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:48.960
She's tall!

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:49.870
Tenth grade? Really?

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:51.880
Tall girls are cute!

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:55.950
My parents run a Japanese confectionery called Lotus Moon.

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:58.940
It's delicious, so please try it!

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:01.680
Don't advertise.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.200
I'm Hinata Yachiyo.

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:09.370
I'm fifteen!

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:10.480
I'm in tenth grade!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:11.720
You in elementary school?

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:12.590
You're tiny!

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:13.530
Are you okay?

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:15.880
Don't call me tiny!

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:24.110
Why gym clothes?

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:25.480
Isn't it cute?

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:27.290
The shorts do it.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.390
I'm Yamato Yury—

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.960
I mean, Yamato Yura.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:34.840
She seems like a clumsy one.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:38.510
Nah, her talent's no laughing matter.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.720
She only joined our team in spring, but she's already a core member.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:45.160
So you say, but her style's a bit... eccentric.

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:48.090
Her file says she's your team's rising star.

00:09:48.090 --> 00:09:52.730
Yeah, whatever. Gym shorts are a national treasure!

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:55.360
And nobody in Japan wears it better than her!

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.450
And what's more, she's shown her clumsy side!

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:59.820
Is there anything hotter than that?!

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:02.740
Earth to Kashima...

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:04.730
Good job.

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:08.560
I'm glad it's over.

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:10.750
You were cute, Yura.

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:14.760
You all had such cool battle outfits...

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:18.760
She's up next, huh?

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:22.700
I'm actually a guy, so I might be in the wrong bracket.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:24.140
Sorry!

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:24.180
A boy is fine, too

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.320
Don't worry!

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:26.770
You're cute, that's enough!

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:28.730
To the next one, then.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:30.880
Meisei Girls' Academy.

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.270
Haruna Rin!

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:42.060
I'm... Haruna Rin.

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:43.420
I'm seventeen.

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:45.640
I'm in twelfth grade.

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:50.040
I'm... not used to this...

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:56.800
Rin

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:56.800
But my friends came all this way to support me...

00:10:58.030 --> 00:10:59.300
so I'll do my best!

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:07.810
What the fuck?

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.480
Is that an impostor?

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:13.110
Impressive.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.530
She's so cute when she laughs.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:24.400
She's a well-known regular for airsoft tournaments, but...

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:26.040
isn't that just a normal sailor uniform?

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:29.720
No, a Grease gun needs a sailor uniform.

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:32.280
She was a total crybaby as a kid,

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:35.040
but smiles look good on her, I tell you.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:36.670
Sonora...

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:39.770
Yes, I like this.

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:40.840
We've found our winner!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:42.650
S-Sure...

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:46.720
And now, the long-awaited airsoft games!

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:50.830
Thank goodness.

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:54.230
There won't be any infighting for us in the first round.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:57.530
A battle where only the victors move on...

00:11:57.530 --> 00:11:59.070
I'm so hyped!

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:00.360
Yeah.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:03.210
Let's stick to what we do best.

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:04.280
Let's have fun...

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.650
and win!

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:12.190
The game has begun!

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:17.750
The first game in the first round is between Hatsuse Karira and Yaguchi Seina!

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:22.570
You can follow the proceedings live with cameras installed around the skirm site!

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:23.260
Hit!

00:12:23.770 --> 00:12:24.570
Whoa!

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:26.990
Karira has put a quick end to this game!

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:30.250
Speed's always been her only asset.

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:33.160
Well, we had a hit in this match,

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:36.770
but if we don't get a hit within twelve minutes,

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:40.990
the winner will be decided by popularity vote!

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:48.780
Of course, you can vote based on the style of the players over their substance!

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:51.290
Airsoft is all about fun.

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:55.310
Making the games interesting for the viewers is part of their duty.

00:12:56.560 --> 00:13:16.560
Highlights of the First Round

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:22.360
The last game of the first round will be between two favorites!

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:25.860
Hinata Yachiyo and Seto Aoi will square off!

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:33.580
Snipers are skilled at hiding themselves,

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.290
but against my eyes,

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.580
and my nose,

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.540
you're completely exposed!

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:45.760
Now, for a play-by-play of the final round one match!

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:50.360
It looks like Hinata is trying to snipe her opponent from hiding in this game.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:52.490
Seto's ability to see through that plan

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:54.190
will determine the outcome!

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:56.520
Seto Aoi has prepared a very special maneuver for this.

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:58.150
I ain't afraid of no snipers!

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:59.810
Don't try this at home, kids!

00:13:58.150 --> 00:13:59.810
Once I close in...

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:01.310
you're done for!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.840
What... the hell?

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:29.890
That costume!

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:32.890
You might think it's pretty conspicuous for a sniper,

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:35.880
but she's always been one to stand out.

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:42.250
That island bullshit won't save you now!

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:44.610
We're fighting one on one here!

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:47.070
Holy hell!

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.290
This match is mad fire!

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:51.660
Seto just can't close in!

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:00.620
Hit!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:05.530
Hinata Yachiyo has won the last game of the first round!

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:09.020
We're going into the quarterfinals!

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:12.180
You all won your games!

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:15.180
Time to get serious.

00:15:15.840 --> 00:15:17.850
No hard feelings, ladies!

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:19.520
Let's do this!

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:22.020
Let's go, Yura.

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:24.550
I won't lose!

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:28.280
Hatsuse Karira   VS   Yamato Yura

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:33.740
Eat this, Kari!

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:39.000
Hit.

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:48.600
I lost.

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:50.630
Is something wrong?

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:54.390
I'm watching Kari's game.

00:15:57.020 --> 00:16:01.100
Our first semifinal is somehow a battle between brother and sister!

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:04.780
Couldn't finish it up in time, huh?

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:09.150
Let the match be decided by popularity vote, then!

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:11.740
Going by the battle we just saw,

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:14.910
I think it's fair to say Karira was the better one.

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:18.040
Please vote for me.

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:20.290
Hatsuse Karira

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:23.000
How the hell am I losing?!

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:25.670
Wh-What happened to your clothes?!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.920
What the crap?!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.970
Is this really an accident?!

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:37.180
The embarrassment of such a hot-headed girl is turning the tables!

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:42.940
The sexuality of a tomboy is basically the best thing ever.

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:46.060
A win is a win.

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:48.860
<i>Is this legal?</i>

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:53.450
We've all been looking forward to the second semifinal.

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:57.280
Haruna Rin and Mutsu Honoka are facing each other!

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:00.950
Would you say that Rin has an overwhelming advantage?

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:05.750
Didn't I tell you I'd keep Stella from winning?

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:08.750
I'd like to see you try.

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:13.420
It looks like she's saying something.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:15.260
I wonder what they're saying.

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:19.970
What do you think will happen if you win?

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:26.480
Sono, the former queen, will crown you.

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:31.180
People will ask her about you.

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:35.470
And knowing Sono, she'll tell them anything they want to know.

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:42.510
She'll talk for hours about all the fun you two had that she couldn't say at your introduction.

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:45.000
I'm certainly looking forward to it.

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:54.510
Hit.

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:56.920
Well, what a surprise!

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:59.550
Haruna put up almost no resistance!

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:01.890
Did Honoka wage psychological warfare?

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:03.850
That's strange.

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:06.940
Rin's as iron-willed as they come.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:13.440
Yes, it's quite regrettable we didn't get to see any of her special techniques.

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:16.060
Onto the finals, then!

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:22.200
After a 30-minute break, we will cover the final between Hatsuse Karira and Mutsu Honoka!

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:22.530
~ Final Match ~

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:32.060
To your positions!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.520
Good job, Kari!

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:57.000
Hono's doing work, too!

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:58.950
I wonder who's going to win.

00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:06.990
The battle rages back and forth, but do you agree that Honoka has the edge?

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:11.040
Yeah, she knows Karira's habits.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.800
But she can't keep up with her speed.

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.550
This is shaping up to be a great match.

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:23.300
Of course it'll be close when we know each other so well.

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.850
I can't let myself be predictable!

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:38.080
Mere minutes are left!

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:40.570
Will we see a result?!

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:00.920
Game over!

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:04.270
A popularity vote will decide it!

00:20:04.270 --> 00:20:05.600
Isn't that shy look great?!

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:11.050
Will the rock-headed tomboy beauty known as Hatsuse Karira win?

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:13.310
Too early to tell.

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:16.430
Kari's gonna win, right?

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:18.070
She's got stage presence.

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:19.960
Sorry about this.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:25.030
Glasses girls are always doomed for second place.

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:27.080
I have other tricks up my sleeve.

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:40.710
Uh... huh.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:44.670
Each and every shot is Playboy-worthy!

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:47.100
She was always aware of the camera angles,

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:50.510
and did her best to show off that porn star-tier body!

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:51.440
You're right!

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:56.730
Her most powerful weapon is her 95 cm C-cup bust!

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:02.740
Karira, the thing about glasses girls is...

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:05.470
when they take them off,

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:07.530
they always take the spotlight!

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:20.500
She used the cliché of removing the dorky glasses and revealing the bombshell underneath to take the victory!

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:32.390
Once again, Stella shall not be forgiven.

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:35.560
You won inside our hearts, Rin!

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.560
Your smile was cute.

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:42.940
We'll practice when we get home.

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:45.550
Okay!

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:49.990
Hey, come here!

00:21:50.430 --> 00:21:51.330
Okay!

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:57.340
Smile!

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:03.040
Let's play another round!

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:04.840
I second that!

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:06.780
Want to change the teams now?

00:22:10.140 --> 00:22:11.060
Command!

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:12.930
Control!

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:15.190
Communication!

00:22:15.190 --> 00:22:16.230
The C3 Club!

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:16.850
Yay!

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:20.070
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:23.400
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:28.530
Smile, 'cause isn't this fun?

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:30.620
Yay!

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:36.750
I blush when I make eye contact with my comrade,

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:38.580
but that's fine

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:41.710
Let's trust each other and laugh

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:42.710
Ready?

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:45.220
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:45.220 --> 00:22:48.260
Take your comrade and get the flag!

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:51.970
Can't you feel your heart thump when you advance?

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:55.060
Let's hit them and laugh

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:55.980
All right?

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:58.600
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:01.940
It can be hard, it can be vexing,

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:04.780
but when you overcome that

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:11.870
you'll smile like you never did before

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:13.580
Everyone, take up positions!

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:14.120
Okay!

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:18.580
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:21.710
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:25.800
Enjoy your youth, even if your tears are stolen

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:31.850
Telepathy, a step forward

00:23:31.850 --> 00:23:34.890
Don't look down, look ahead

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:35.770
Sorry it took me so long to be enthusiastic about it!
